<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 2ND INNS 124-3 AT LUNCH V PAKISTAN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 2ND INNS 124-3 AT LUNCH V PAKISTAN.</headline>
<dateline>SHEIKHUPURA, Pakistan 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe, 178 behind Pakistan on first innings, were 124-3 in their second innings at lunch on the fifth and final day of the first test on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Zimbabwe 375 and 124-3, Pakistan 553.</p>
